# Copy to .env if you need it — NOT required for the default setup where one
# Render service serves both the game and the WebSocket relay (the client
# auto-detects that case with zero configuration, see src/net/Regions.js).
#
# Only set this if you host the CLIENT separately from the relay (e.g. the
# built game on GitHub Pages/Vercel/Netlify, and only the WebSocket relay on
# Render). Vite only reads this at BUILD time — after changing it you must
# run `npm run build` again for it to take effect.
# VITE_WS_URL=wss://your-relay-name.onrender.com
